# JVM options for Open Liberty — Próximo Pitido server
#
# --enable-native-access: required for de.bmarwell.proximo.pitido.core, which uses
# the Foreign Function and Memory (FFM) API (java.lang.foreign.SymbolLookup,
# java.lang.foreign.Arena) in LibsoxrChannelMixer to probe for libsoxr.so.0.
# ALL-UNNAMED covers the case where Liberty's OSGi classloader bypasses JPMS named
# modules and our JARs land in the unnamed module.
--enable-native-access=ALL-UNNAMED
